      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d70514339ef3-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Identify the correct statement. &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Identify the correct statement.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Resistance of a wire depends on the length and density of the wire. &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2328;&#2344;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Resistance of a wire depends on the length and density of the wire.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2328;&#2344;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Specific resistance is the same for all conductors. &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Specific resistance is the same for all conductors.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Resistance of a wire depends on the length and cross-section of the wire. &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341; &#2325;&#2366;&#2335; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Resistance of a wire depends on the length and cross-section of the wire.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341; &#2325;&#2366;&#2335; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Specific resistance is dependent on the cross-sectional area of the wire. &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341; &#2325;&#2366;&#2335; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Specific resistance is dependent on the cross-sectional area of the wire.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2379;&#2343; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341; &#2325;&#2366;&#2335; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2349;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Resistance of a wire depends upon:</p><p>&#183; Length of wire: Resistance is directly proportional to the length of a wire.</p><p>&#183; Area of a cross-section of wire: Resistance is inversely proportional to the area of cross-section the wire.</p><p>&#183; The temperature of the wire: Resistance of a wire is directly proportional to the temperature of the wire.</p>",
